{
  "summary": "The experiment tested RNA-only models with multiprofile settings using PCA_n2000 encoding and avgpool aggregation, achieving a validation accuracy of 0.5907 and F1 score of 0.5727, which exceeds the singleprofile baseline (0.4849 accuracy, 0.4639 F1). This suggests multiprofile configurations may enhance performance with RNA-only data, though uncertainty remains about the potential benefits of incorporating image data or alternative aggregation methods."
}

